{
  "id": "alg7-c4-s2-n37",
  "card_id": "alg7-c4-s2-n37",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "37",
  "title": "积和分式的平方根",
  "printed_title": "37. 积和分式的平方根",
  "start_page": 227,
  "start_printed": 221,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 22,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "比较 $\\sqrt{81\\times4}$ 和 $\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$ 的值：\n$\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{324}=\\sqrt{18^2}=18$，\n$\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}=9\\times2=18$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们来比较根式 $\\sqrt{81\\times4}$ 和 $\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$ 的值：$\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{324}=\\sqrt{18^2}=18$，$\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}=9\\times2=18$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两式的值相同，因此 $\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们看到，$\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理1 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$，那么：\n$\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "定理1 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$，那么 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "要证明当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时，等式 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$（1）成立，只需证明 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}\\geq 0$ 和 $(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$。\n根据算术平方根的定义，这两点成立就能得到等式（1）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "为了证明当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时等式$\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$　　(1)成立，我们应当规定 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}\\geq 0$ 和 $(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$.于是，根据二次根式的定义，就能断定在给定的变量值下，等式（1）是正确的.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1) 积 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$ 是非负数。\n因为当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时，$\\sqrt{a}$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}$ 都有意义，且都取非负值。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "1) 积 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$ 是非负的，因为按照二次根式的性质，当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时，根式 $\\sqrt{a}$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}$ 当中的每一个都有意义并且取非负值.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2) 根据积的幂的性质：\n$(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=(\\sqrt{a})^2\\cdot(\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "2) 按照积的幂的性质，$(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=(\\sqrt{a})^2\\cdot(\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两点都已证明，所以等式（1）成立。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "于是，等式（1）成立.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "算术平方根的积满足下面的性质：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "因此，对于算术平方根来说，下面的性质成立：",
      "changes": ["wording"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两个非负因数的积的平方根，等于这两个因数的平方根的积。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "两个非负因数的积的平方根等于这两个因数的平方根的积.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当根号下有两个以上的非负因数时，这个定理仍成立。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "根号下面的因数多于两个时，定理也成立.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "分式的算术平方根也有类似的性质。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "分式的算术平方根具有类似的性质.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理2 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$，那么：\n$\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$。\n要证明当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，等式 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$（2）成立，可以沿用定理1的证明方法，只需证明 $\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\geq 0$，且 $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\right)^2=\\frac{a}{b}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 221,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0227#13",
        "p0228#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "定理2 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$.为了证明当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，等式$\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$　　(2)成立，我们利用和证明定理1时同样的方法，就是证明在给定的变量值下，$\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\geq 0$，　$\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\right)^2=\\frac{a}{b}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1) 商 $\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$ 是非负数。\n因为当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，$\\sqrt{a}$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}$ 都有意义，并且 $\\sqrt{a}\\geq 0$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}>0$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "1) 商 $\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$ 的值是非负的. 因为按照二次根式的性质，当$a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，式 $\\sqrt{a}$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}$ 当中的每一个都有意义，并且$\\sqrt{a}\\geq 0$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}>0$.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2) 根据分式的幂的性质：\n$\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\right)^2=\\frac{(\\sqrt{a})^2}{(\\sqrt{b})^2}=\\frac{a}{b}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "2) 按照分式的幂的性质，$\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}\\right)^2=\\frac{(\\sqrt{a})^2}{(\\sqrt{b})^2}=\\frac{a}{b}$.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据算术平方根的定义，当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，等式（2）成立。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "根据二次根式的定义，当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$ 时，等式（2）成立.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "分子非负、分母为正的分式，其平方根等于分子的平方根除以分母的平方根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "于是，分子是非负数而分母是正数的分式的平方根，等于分子的平方根除以分母的平方根.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面用几个例子应用这两个定理。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们举几个应用这两个定理的例子.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1. 求 $\\sqrt{64\\times0.04}$ 的值。\n根据定理1：\n$\\sqrt{64\\times0.04}=\\sqrt{64}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.04}=8\\times0.2=1.6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "1. 求 $\\sqrt{64\\times0.04}$ 的值.利用定理1：$\\sqrt{64\\times0.04}=\\sqrt{64}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.04}=8\\times0.2=1.6$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 求 $\\sqrt{32\\times98}$ 的值。\n先把被开方数分解为完全平方数的积：\n$32\\times98=(16\\times2)(49\\times2)=16\\times49\\times4$。\n再求 $\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}$ 的值，根据积的平方根的性质：\n$\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}=\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{4}=4\\times7\\times2=56$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 222,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0228#8",
        "p0229#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "2. 求根式 $\\sqrt{32\\times98}$ 的值.将被开方式变形：$32\\times98=(16\\times2)(49\\times2)=16\\times49\\times4$.为了求出 $\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}$ 的值，利用关于非负因数的积的平方根的定理，得到：$\\sqrt{16\\times49\\times4}=\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{4}=4\\times7\\times2=56$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例3. 求 $\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}$ 的值。\n根据定理2：\n$\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{36}}{\\sqrt{169}}=\\frac{6}{13}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 223,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0229#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "3. 求 $\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}$ 的值.根据定理2，得：$\\sqrt{\\frac{36}{169}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{33}}{\\sqrt{169}}=\\frac{6}{13}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout",
        "math-correction"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例4. 把 $\\sqrt{49a^2}$ 写成单项式，其中 $a<0$。\n根据积的平方根的性质：\n$\\sqrt{49a^2}=\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{a^2}=7\\times|a|$。\n因为 $a<0$，所以 $|a|=-a$，于是：\n$\\sqrt{49a^2}=7\\times(-a)=-7a$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 223,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0229#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "4. 把 $\\sqrt{49a^2}$（$a<0$）写成单项式.根据关于非负因数的积的平方根定理，$\\sqrt{49a^2}=\\sqrt{49}\\times\\sqrt{a^2}=7\\times|a|$.如果 $a<0$，那么 $|a|=-a$，于是，$\\sqrt{49a^2}=7\\times(-a)=-7a$.",
      "changes": ["wording", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例5. 求 $\\sqrt{20}\\times\\sqrt{5}$ 的值。\n在等式 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\times\\sqrt{b}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b\\geq 0$）中，调换两边，得到：\n$\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{ab}$。\n于是：\n$\\sqrt{20}\\cdot\\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{100}=10$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 223,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0229#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "5. 求积 $\\sqrt{20}\\times\\sqrt{5}$ 的值.我们把等式 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\times\\sqrt{b}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b\\geq 0$）写成另一形式，就是：$\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{ab}$.得到：$\\sqrt{20}\\cdot\\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{100}=10$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例6. 求 $\\frac{\\sqrt{80}}{\\sqrt{5}}$ 的值。\n在等式 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b>0$）中，调换两边，得到：\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$。\n于是：\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{80}}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{80}{5}}=\\sqrt{16}=4$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 223,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0229#5",
        "p0230#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "6. 求商 $\\frac{\\sqrt{80}}{\\sqrt{5}}$ 的值.我们把等式 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$（$a\\geq 0$，$b>0$）写成另一形式，就是：$\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$.得到：$\\frac{\\sqrt{80}}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{80}{5}}=\\sqrt{16}=4$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例7. 把 $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}$ 写成 $a\\sqrt{b}$ 的形式，其中 $a$ 是有理数，$b$ 是自然数。\n把分式 $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}$ 的分子和分母同时乘以 $\\sqrt{2}$，得到：\n$\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}=1.5\\sqrt{2}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 224,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0230#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "7. 把 $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}$ 写成 $a\\sqrt{b}$ 的形式，其中 $a$ 是有理数，$b$ 是自然数.我们把分式 $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}$ 的分子和分母乘以 $\\sqrt{2}$，得：$\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}\\times\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}=1.5\\sqrt{2}$.",
      "changes": [
        "wording",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
